  "text": "Skip to content\nSoren Hale\n01\nWork\n02\nServices\n03\nAbout\n04\nLab\n05\nWriting\nOpen to work from November\nGet in touch\n~\nWork\nLoopdocs\n\n// Case study\n\nLoopdocs \n\nDeveloper docs that load at once and search as you type.\n\nVisit the live site\nRead the code\n\nTime to the first search result\nfrom\n1.9 s\n→\nto\n0.4 s\n\nClient\nLoopdocs\nYear\n2022\nRole\nFrontend developer\nKind\nWeb\n01\nThe problem\n\nLoopdocs hosts API documentation for other companies. Search was a round trip to a server and the sidebar re-rendered on every page.\n\n02\nThe approach\nPages are static; only the search box and the code tabs are interactive.\nThe search index ships in small pieces and loads the moment the box gets focus.\nCode samples remember the language you picked last.\nA developer at two monitors at night with city lights behind\nTwo developers working late on laptops, city lights outside\n03\nThe result\n\nThe first search result now shows in 0.4 s instead of 1.9 s, and the docs score 100 on every Lighthouse category.\n\nBuilt with\n\nAstro\nTypeScript\nPagefind\nMDX\n\nNext case\nWeb · 2021\nParcelway Tracking\nThe tracking page three million people open every month, at a seventh of the weight.\n\n// Start a project\n\nTell me what you are building. \n\nThree quick picks so the first reply is useful. You finish the message on the contact page.\n\n01\nWhat do you need?\n\nFrontend build\nPerformance audit\nDesign system\nTeam embed\nSomething else\n\n02\nRough budget\n\nUnder €5k\n€5–10k\n€10–25k\n€25k+\nNot sure yet\n03\nYour name or company\nbrief.ts\ndraft, not sent\nexport const brief = {\nkind: null // not picked yet,\nbudget: null // not picked yet,\nname: null // not picked yet,\n}\n\nBrief so far: nothing picked yet\n\nContinue to contact\n\nor write to hello@sorenhale.dev\n\nNothing is sent from this page. Your picks are kept in this browser tab and wait for you on the contact form.\n\nFooter\n\nFrontend developer, Oslo\n\nWrite to me\nhello@sorenhale.dev\n\nOpen to work from November\n\n// Site\n\nWork\nServices\nProcess\nReviews\nContact\n\n// About\n\nAbout\nResume\nStack\nUses\nNow\n\n// More\n\nLab\nWriting\nFAQ\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\n// Elsewhere\n\nGitHub\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nLinkedIn\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nBluesky\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nLocal time, Oslo\n17:02 CEST\n\n© 2026 Soren Hale. Written by hand in Oslo.\n\nSorenHale\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.\n\nEdit Content",
